es performances","Intégration de REST API"],"de":["Entwicklung maßgeschneiderter Themes","Erstellung von Plugins","Entwicklung von Gutenberg-Blöcken","Anpassung von WooCommerce","Leistungsoptimierung","Integration von REST API"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de temas personalizados","Criação de plugins personalizados","Otimização de desempenho de WordPress","Desenvolvimento de blocos Gutenberg","Customização de WooCommerce","Integração com REST API"],"ru":["Разработка кастомных тем","Создание кастомных плагинов","Оптимизация производительности WordPress","Разработка блоков Gutenberg","Настройка WooCommerce","Интеграция с REST API"],"ar":["تصميم تصاميم مخصصة","إنشاء ملحقات مخصصة","تحسين أداء ووردبريس","تطوير كتلة جوتنبرج","تخصيص ووكوميرس","دمج REST API"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress 开发","全栈开发","自定义主题","插件开发","Gutenberg 块","WooCommerce","性能优化"],"ja":["WordPress 開発","フルスタック開発","カスタムテーマ","プラグイン開発","Gutenberg ブロック","WooCommerce","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["워드프레스 개발","풀스택 개발","커스텀 테마","플러그인 개발","거트버그 블록","우커머스","성능 최적화"],"es":["desarrollador WordPress Pro","temas personalizados","plugins","Gutenberg","WooCommerce","optimización de rendimiento","REST API","desarrollo web","soluciones personalizadas"],"fr":["développeur WordPress Pro","thèmes personnalisés","plugins","Gutenberg","WooCommerce","optimisation des performances","REST API","développement web","solutions personnalisées"],"de":["WordPress Pro-Entwickler","maßgeschneiderte Themes","Plugins","Gutenberg","WooCommerce","Leistungsoptimierung","REST API","Webentwicklung","maßgeschneiderte Lösungen"],"pt":["desenvolvedor wordpress","temas personalizados","plugins wordpress","otimização de desempenho","gutenberg blocks","woocommerce","rest api","desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas"],"ru":["разработчик wordpress","кастомные темы","плагины wordpress","оптимизация производительности","блоки гутенберга","woocommerce","rest api","разработка кастомных решений"],"ar":["مطور ووردبريس","تصاميم مخصصة","ملحقات ووردبريس","تحسين الأداء","كتلة جوتنبرج","ووكوميرس","REST API","تطوير حلول مخصصة"]}},"owner":"Jeffallan","repo":"claude-skills","repoPath":"Jeffallan/claude-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.576Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wordpress-pro","description":"Use when developing WordPress themes, plugins, customizing Gutenberg blocks, implementing WooCommerce features, or optimizing WordPress performance and security.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress s","body":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress sites following WordPress coding standards and best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building custom WordPress themes with template hierarchy\n- Developing WordPress plugins with proper architecture\n- Creating custom Gutenberg blocks and block patterns\n- Customizing WooCommerce functionality\n- Implementing WordPress REST API endpoints\n- Optimizing WordPress performance and security\n- Working with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)\n- Full Site Editing (FSE) and block themes\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Understand WordPress context, existing setup, goals\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan theme/plugin structure, hooks, data flow\n3. **Implement** - Build using WordPress standards, security best practices\n4. **Optimize** - Cache, query optimization, asset optimization\n5. **Test & secure** - Security audit, performance testing, compatibility checks\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Theme Development | `references/theme-development.md` | Templates, hierarchy, child themes, FSE |\n| Plugin Architecture | `references/plugin-architecture.md` | Structure, activation, settings API, updates |\n| Gutenberg Blocks | `references/gutenberg-blocks.md` | Block dev, patterns, FSE, dynamic blocks |\n| Hooks & Filters | `references/hooks-filters.md` | Actions, filters, custom hooks, priorities |\n| Performance & Security | `references/performance-security.md` | Caching, optimization, hardening, backups |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS)\n- Use nonces for form submissions\n- Sanitize all user inputs with appropriate functions\n- Escape all outputs (esc_html, esc_url, esc_attr)\n- Use prepared statements for database queries\n- Implement proper capability checks\n- Enqueue scripts/styles properly (wp_enqueue_*)\n- Use WordPress hooks instead of modifying core\n- Write translatable strings with text domains\n- Test across multiple WordPress versions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Modify WordPress core files\n- Use PHP short tags or deprecated functions\n- Trust user input without sanitization\n- Output data without escaping\n- Hardcode database table names (use $wpdb->prefix)\n- Skip capability checks in admin functions\n- Ignore SQL injection vulnerabilities\n- Bundle unnecessary libraries (use WordPress APIs)\n- Create security vulnerabilities through file uploads\n- Skip internationalization (i18n)\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WordPress features, provide:\n1. Main plugin/theme file with proper headers\n2. Relevant template files or block code\n3. Functions with proper WordPress hooks\n4. Security implementations (nonces, sanitization, escaping)\n5. Brief explanation of WordPress-specific patterns used\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nWordPress 6.4+, PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg, WooCommerce, ACF, REST API, WP-CLI, block development, theme customizer, widget API, shortcode API, transients, object caching, query optimization, security hardening, WPCS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:43:45.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Developer Agents seeking advanced WordPress customization and performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合寻求高级WordPress自定义和性能优化能力的全栈开发者代理。","ja":"高度なWordPressのカスタマイズとパフォーマンスの最適化機能を求めるフルスタック開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 워드프레스 사용자 지정 및 성능 최적화 기능을 찾는 풀 스택 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrolladores de Pilas Completas que buscan personalización avanzada de WordPress y capacidades de optimización de rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développeurs full-stack recherchant une personnalisation avancée de WordPress et des capacités d''optimisation des performances.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Entwickler-Agenten, die erweiterte WordPress-Anpassung und Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedores Full-Stack que buscam personalização avançada do WordPress e capacidades de otimização de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков full-stack, ищущих расширенные возможности настройки WordPress и оптимизации производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء مطورو الويب الكامل الذين يبحثون عن تعديلات متقدمة لبرنامج WordPress وقدرات تحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop custom WordPress themes, plugins, and Gutenberg blocks, leveraging PHP 8.1+, REST API integration, and WooCommerce customization for scalable and secure solutions.","zh":"赋予代理开发自定义WordPress主题、插件和Gutenberg块的能力，利用PHP 8.1+、REST API集成和WooCommerce自定义实现可扩展和安全的解决方案。","ja":"エージェントがカスタムのWordPressテーマ、プラグイン、Gutenbergブロックを開発できるようにし、PHP 8.1+、REST APIの統合、WooCommerceのカスタマイズを利用してスケーラブルでセキュアなソリューションを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 지정 워드프레스 테마, 플러그인 및 구텐베르크 블록을 개발할 수 있도록 하고 PHP 8.1+, REST API 통합 및 우커머스 사용자 지정 기능을 사용하여 확장 가능하고 보안이 강화된 솔루션을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar temas personalizados de WordPress, plugins y bloques de Gutenberg, aprovechando la integración de PHP 8.1+, REST API y personalización de WooCommerce para soluciones escalables y seguras.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des thèmes WordPress personnalisés, des plugins et des blocs Gutenberg, en exploitant l''intégration de PHP 8.1+, de l''API REST et de la personnalisation de WooCommerce pour des solutions évolutives et sécurisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Themes, -Plugins und Gutenberg-Blöcke zu entwickeln, indem PHP 8.1+, REST-API-Integration und WooCommerce-Anpassung für skalierbare und sichere Lösungen genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam temas personalizados do WordPress, plug-ins e blocos do Gutenberg, aproveitando a integração do PHP 8.1+, API REST e personalização do WooCommerce para soluções escaláveis e seguras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать пользовательские темы WordPress, плагины и блоки Gutenberg, используя интеграцию PHP 8.1+, REST API и настройку WooCommerce для масштабируемых и безопасных решений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية تطوير موضوعات ووردبريس مخصصة وأدوات إضافية وكتل جوتنبرج، مستفيدة من دمج PHP 8.1+ و API REST وتعديل WooCommerce من أجل حلول قابلة للتوسيع وأمنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom WordPress themes with modern PHP and Gutenberg block development","Optimizing WordPress performance with expert-level caching and REST API integration","Developing and customizing WooCommerce plugins for e-commerce solutions"],"zh":["使用现代PHP和Gutenberg块开发构建自定义WordPress主题","使用专家级缓存和REST API集成优化WordPress性能","开发和自定义WooCommerce插件用于电子商务解决方案"],"ja":["モダンPHPとGutenbergブロック開発を使用してカスタムのWordPressテーマを構築する","専門家レベルのキャッシュとREST APIの統合を使用してWordPressのパフォーマンスを最適化する","電子商取引ソリューションのためにWooCommerceプラグインを開発し、カスタマイズする"],"ko":["최신 PHP 및 구텐베르크 블록 개발을 사용하여 사용자 지정 워드프레스 테마를 구축하는 것","전문가 수준의 캐싱 및 REST API 통합을 사용하여 워드프레스 성능을 최적화하는 것","전자상거래 솔루션을 위해 우커머스 플러그인을 개발 및 사용자 지정하는 것"],"es":["Creación de temas personalizados de WordPress con PHP moderno y desarrollo de bloques de Gutenberg","Optimización del rendimiento de WordPress con caché de nivel experto y integración de la API de REST","Desarrollo y personalización de plugins de WooCommerce para soluciones de comercio electrónico"],"fr":["Création de thèmes WordPress personnalisés avec PHP moderne et développement de blocs Gutenberg","Optimisation des performances de WordPress avec un cache de niveau expert et une intégration de l''API REST","Développement et personnalisation de plugins WooCommerce pour des solutions de commerce électronique"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter WordPress-Themes mit modernem PHP und Gutenberg-Block-Entwicklung","Optimierung der WordPress-Leistung mit Experten-Caching und REST-API-Integration","Entwicklung und Anpassung von WooCommerce-Plugins für E-Commerce-Lösungen"],"pt":["Criação de temas personalizados do WordPress com desenvolvimento de blocos modernos do PHP e Gutenberg","Otimização do desempenho do WordPress com cache de nível de especialista e integração da API REST","Desenvolvimento e personalização de plug-ins do WooCommerce para soluções de comércio eletrônico"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских тем WordPress с современным PHP и разработкой блоков Gutenberg","Оптимизация производительности WordPress с помощью экспертного кэширования и интеграции REST API","Разработка и настройка плагинов WooCommerce для решений электронной коммерции"],"ar":["إنشاء مواضيع مخصصة لبرنامج ووردبريس باستخدام تطوير كتل PHP الحديثة وجوتنبرج","تحسين أداء برنامج ووردبريس باستخدام ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت ذات المستوى الخبير ودمج API REST","تطوير وتعديل أدوات إضافية لبرنامج ووردبريس التجاري من أجل حلول التجارة الإلكترونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.1+ compatibility","Limited to WordPress ecosystem and compatible plugins"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.1+兼容性","仅限于WordPress生态系统和兼容插件"],"ja":["PHP 8.1+の互換性が必要","WordPressのエコシステムと互換性のあるプラグインに限定される"],"ko":["PHP 8.1+ 호환성을 필요로 함","워드프레스 생태계 및 호환 플러그인으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con PHP 8.1+","Limitado al ecosistema de WordPress y plugins compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec PHP 8.1+","Limité à l''écosystème WordPress et aux plugins compatibles"],"de":["Benötigt PHP 8.1+-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf das WordPress-Ökosystem und kompatible Plugins"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o PHP 8.1+","Limitado ao ecossistema do WordPress e plug-ins compatíveis"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с PHP 8.1+","Ограничен экосистемой WordPress и совместимыми плагинами"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع PHP 8.1+","محدود بنظام برنامج ووردبريس والملحقات المتوافقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"161e8ea72a5640682907e80c2eec76f5e588d9a6c07125db79f4c9e067e33018","qualityScore":70}');
