ec le gestionnaire de paquets CCPI"],"de":["Automatische Generierung von API-Dokumentationen","Kompatibilität mit REST, GraphQL und OpenAPI","Authentifizierungsmuster und API-Designmuster","Interaktive Tutorien und Codebeispiele","Integration mit dem Paketmanager CCPI"],"pt":["Criação automática de documentação Swagger","Suporte a padrões de API REST, GraphQL e OpenAPI","Recursos de autenticação e design de API","Guias passo a passo para criação de documentação","Integração com o gerenciador de pacotes CCPI"],"ru":["Автоматическое создание докуметации Swagger","Поддержка стандартов API REST, GraphQL и OpenAPI","Возможности аутентификации и проектирования API","Пошаговые руководства для создания докуметации","Интеграция с менеджером пакетов CCPI"],"ar":["إنشاء تلقائي لوثائق Swagger","دعم لمعايير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST و GraphQL و OpenAPI","ميزات مصادقة وتصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دلائل خطوة بخطوة لإنشاء الوثائق","التكامل مع مدير الحزم CCPI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Swagger API","API ","REST API","GraphQL API","OpenAPI","API ","Swagger"],"ja":["Swagger API","API ","REST API","GraphQL API","OpenAPI","API ","Swagger"],"ko":["Swagger API","API ","REST API","GraphQL API","OpenAPI","API ","Swagger"],"es":["creador de documentación Swagger","generación de documentación de API","desarrollo de API","REST","GraphQL","OpenAPI","autenticación","diseño de API"],"fr":["créateur de documentation Swagger","génération de documentation d''API","développement d''API","REST","GraphQL","OpenAPI","authentification","conception d''API"],"de":["Swagger-Dokumentationsersteller","Generierung von API-Dokumentationen","API-Entwicklung","REST","GraphQL","OpenAPI","Authentifizierung","API-Design"],"pt":["criação de documentação Swagger","desenvolvimento de API","padrões de API","autenticação de API","design de API","CCPI","Swagger"],"ru":["создание докуметации Swagger","разработка API","стандарты API","аутентификация API","проектирование API","CCPI","Swagger"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق Swagger","تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","معايير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","مصادقة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","CCPI","Swagger"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"swagger-doc-creator","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Swagger Doc Creator\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for swagger doc creator tasks within the API Development domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"swagger doc creator\" in your request\n- Ask about swagger doc creator patterns or best practices\n- Need help with api development skills covering rest, graphql, openapi, authentication, and api design patterns.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for swagger doc creator","body":"# Swagger Doc Creator\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for swagger doc creator tasks within the API Development domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"swagger doc creator\" in your request\n- Ask about swagger doc creator patterns or best practices\n- Need help with api development skills covering rest, graphql, openapi, authentication, and api design patterns.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for swagger doc creator\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with swagger doc creator\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of api development concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **API Development** skill category.\nTags: api, rest, graphql, openapi, swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:47:19.067Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API Development Agents requiring automated OpenAPI documentation generation and RESTful API design patterns.","zh":"适用于需要自动化 OpenAPI 文档生成和 RESTful API 设计模式的 API 开发代理。","ja":"OpenAPI ドキュメントの自動生成と RESTful API デザイン パターンを必要とする API 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 OpenAPI 문서 생성 및 RESTful API 디자인 패턴이 필요한 API 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de API que requieren generación automática de documentación de OpenAPI y patrones de diseño de API RESTful.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement d''API nécessitant une génération automatique de documentation OpenAPI et des modèles de conception d''API RESTful.","de":"Ideal für API-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine automatisierte OpenAPI-Dokumentenerstellung und RESTful-API-Designmuster erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento de API que exigem geração automatizada de documentação OpenAPI e padrões de design de API RESTful.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки API, требующих автоматизированного создания документации OpenAPI и моделей проектирования RESTful API.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التي تتطلب إنتاجًا تلقائيًا لتوثيق OpenAPI وأنماط تصميم API RESTful."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Swagger documentation with ease, supporting OpenAPI, REST, GraphQL, and authentication protocols, while providing interactive tutorials and production orchestration patterns.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理 Swagger 文档的能力，支持 OpenAPI、REST、GraphQL 和身份验证协议，并提供交互式教程和生产编排模式。","ja":"OpenAPI、REST、GraphQL、および認証プロトコルをサポートし、インタラクティブなチュートリアルとプロダクション オーケストレーション パターンを提供することで、エージェントが Swagger ドキュメントを作成および管理できるようにします。","ko":"OpenAPI, REST, GraphQL 및 인증 프로토콜을 지원하고, 상호작용형 튜토리얼 및 프로덕션 오케스트레이션 패턴을 제공함으로써 에이전트가 Swagger 문서를 쉽게 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y gestionar documentación de Swagger con facilidad, compatible con OpenAPI, REST, GraphQL y protocolos de autenticación, al mismo tiempo que proporciona tutoriales interactivos y patrones de orquestación de producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer facilement la documentation Swagger, en prenant en charge OpenAPI, REST, GraphQL et les protocoles d''authentification, tout en fournissant des didacticiels interactifs et des modèles d''orchestration de production.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Swagger-Dokumentation mit Leichtigkeit zu erstellen und zu verwalten, unterstützt OpenAPI, REST, GraphQL und Authentifizierungsprotokolle, während interaktive Tutorien und Produktionsorchestrierungsmuster bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e gerenciem documentação Swagger com facilidade, dando suporte ao OpenAPI, REST, GraphQL e protocolos de autenticação, além de fornecer tutoriais interativos e padrões de orquestração de produção.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять документацией Swagger с легкостью, поддерживая OpenAPI, REST, GraphQL и протоколы аутентификации, а также предоставляя интерактивные уроки и модели оркестровки производства.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء ودارة توثيق Swagger بسهولة، مع دعم OpenAPI و REST وGraphQL وبروتوكولات التحقق، بالإضافة إلى تقديم دروس تفاعلية وأنماط إدارة الإنتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Swagger doc creation for API development projects","Generating interactive API documentation with OpenAPI specifications","Debugging RESTful API issues using Swagger documentation best practices"],"zh":["自动化 Swagger 文档创建用于 API 开发项目","使用 OpenAPI 规范生成交互式 API 文档","使用 Swagger 文档最佳实践调试 RESTful API 问题"],"ja":["API 開発プロジェクト用の Swagger ドキュメントの自動生成","OpenAPI 規格を使用したインタラクティブ API ドキュメントの生成","Swagger ドキュメントのベスト プラクティスを使用した RESTful API の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["API 개발 프로젝트를 위한 Swagger 문서 자동 생성","OpenAPI 사양을 사용하여 상호작용형 API 문서 생성","Swagger 문서 최적화 방법을 사용하여 RESTful API 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de documentación de Swagger para proyectos de desarrollo de API","Generar documentación de API interactiva con especificaciones de OpenAPI","Depurar problemas de API RESTful utilizando las mejores prácticas de documentación de Swagger"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de documentation Swagger pour les projets de développement d''API","Générer une documentation d''API interactive avec des spécifications OpenAPI","Déboguer les problèmes d''API RESTful en utilisant les meilleures pratiques de documentation Swagger"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Swagger-Dokumentation für API-Entwicklungsprojekte","Generieren interaktiver API-Dokumentation mit OpenAPI-Spezifikationen","Debuggen von RESTful-API-Problemen unter Verwendung der besten Praktiken für Swagger-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de documentos Swagger para projetos de desenvolvimento de API","Gerar documentação interativa de API com especificações OpenAPI","Depurar problemas de API RESTful usando as melhores práticas de documentação Swagger"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание документации Swagger для проектов разработки API","Генерировать интерактивную документацию API с помощью спецификаций OpenAPI","Отлаживать проблемы RESTful API, используя лучшие практики документации Swagger"],"ar":["تحويل عملية إنشاء توثيق Swagger تلقائيًا لمشاريع تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إنتاج توثيق تفاعلي لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام مواصفات OpenAPI","تصحيح أعطال واجهة برمجة التطبيقات RESTful باستخدام أفضل الممارسات لتوثيق Swagger"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of OpenAPI and RESTful API design principles","Limited to API development domain"],"zh":["需要 OpenAPI 和 RESTful API 设计原则的知识","仅限于 API 开发领域"],"ja":["OpenAPI と RESTful API デザイン プリンシプルの知識が必要","API 開発ドメインに限定される"],"ko":["OpenAPI 및 RESTful API 디자인 원칙에 대한 지식 필요","API 개발 도메인에만 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios de diseño de OpenAPI y API RESTful","Limitado al dominio de desarrollo de API"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances des principes de conception OpenAPI et d''API RESTful","Limité au domaine de développement d''API"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse der OpenAPI- und RESTful-API-Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf das API-Entwicklungsbereich"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos princípios de design de API RESTful e OpenAPI","Limitado ao domínio do desenvolvimento de API"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов проектирования RESTful API и OpenAPI","Ограничен областью разработки API"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمبادئ تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات RESTful و OpenAPI","محدود بنطاق تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"19dc5b0eb8911540b2fca50cef8bce742046ee3515c2cdd9152b87aac19bf6d9","qualityScore":70}');
