o de documentação"],"ru":["создание справок API","техническая документация","оркестровка производства","интерактивные туториалы","управление пакетами","автоматизация документации"],"ar":["إنشاء مراجع وثائق Api","الوثائق الفنية","إدارة الإنتاج","دروس تعليمية تفاعلية","إدارة الحزم","التوثيق الآلي"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-reference-creator","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Api Reference Creator\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for api reference creator tasks within the Technical Documentation domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"api reference creator\" in your request\n- Ask about api reference creator patterns or best practices\n- Need help with technical documentation skills covering api docs, user guides, architecture docs, and documentation automation.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step g","body":"# Api Reference Creator\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for api reference creator tasks within the Technical Documentation domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"api reference creator\" in your request\n- Ask about api reference creator patterns or best practices\n- Need help with technical documentation skills covering api docs, user guides, architecture docs, and documentation automation.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for api reference creator\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with api reference creator\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of technical documentation concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **Technical Documentation** skill category.\nTags: documentation, markdown, api-docs, readme, technical-writing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:47:37.864Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Documentation Agents needing automated API reference creation and technical writing assistance.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化API参考创建和技术写作辅助的技术文档代理","ja":"テクニカルドキュメンテーションエージェントが自動化されたAPIリファレンスの作成と技術文書の支援を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자동화된 API 참조 생성 및 기술 작성 지원이 필요한 기술 문서 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de documentación técnica que necesitan la creación automática de referencias de API y asistencia para la escritura técnica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de documentation technique ayant besoin de création automatique de références d''API et d''assistance pour la rédaction technique.","de":"Perfekt für technische Dokumentationsagenten, die eine automatisierte API-Referenzerstellung und technische Schreibunterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação Técnica que necessitam de criação automática de referência de API e assistência de escrita técnica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации, которым нужна автоматизированная создание справки API и помощь в техническом письме.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء وثائق فنية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مراجع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الآلي ومساعدة الكتابة الفنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality API documentation using production orchestration patterns, interactive tutorials, and the CCPI package manager, supporting formats like Jupyter notebooks and API docs.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的API文档的能力，使用生产编排模式、交互式教程和CCPI包管理器，支持Jupyter笔记本和API文档等格式","ja":"エージェントが、プロダクションオーケストレーションパターン、インタラクティブチュートリアル、およびCCPIパッケージマネージャーを使用して、高品質のAPIドキュメントを生成する能力を提供。JupyterノートブックやAPIドキュメントなどの形式をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 생산 오케스트레이션 패턴, 인터랙티브 튜토리얼 및 CCPI 패키지 관리자를 사용하여 고품질의 API 문서를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, Jupyter 노트북 및 API 문서 등의 형식을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentación de API de alta calidad utilizando patrones de orquestación de producción, tutoriales interactivos y el administrador de paquetes CCPI, que admite formatos como cuadernos Jupyter y documentación de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une documentation d''API de haute qualité en utilisant des modèles d''orchestration de production, des didacticiels interactifs et le gestionnaire de paquets CCPI, prenant en charge des formats tels que les cahiers Jupyter et la documentation d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochwertige API-Dokumentationen unter Verwendung von Produktionsorchestrationsmustern, interaktiven Tutorials und dem CCPI-Paketmanager zu erstellen, der Formate wie Jupyter-Notebooks und API-Dokumentationen unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentação de API de alta qualidade usando padrões de orquestração de produção, tutoriais interativos e o gerenciador de pacotes CCPI, com suporte a formatos como cadernos Jupyter e documentação de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать документацию API высокого качества с помощью шаблонов оркестровки производства, интерактивных уроков и менеджера пакетов CCPI, поддерживающего форматы như ноутбуки Jupyter и документацию API.","ar":"